ms":["文官"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":3,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080328070200700/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/07/08/LCEWA01_090708_00022.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080524070201000","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「入出國及移民法第三十六條條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第16次會議","date":"2019-05-31","highlight":{"excerpt":"本院委員童惠珍等21人，有鑑於「公民與政治權利國際公約」及「經濟社會文化權利國際公約」已國內法化多年；且大法官釋字亦多次闡釋本於憲法第八條及第十六條人身自由及訴訟權應予保障之意旨，政府對人身自由之剝奪尤應遵循正當法律程序原則。","terms":["大法官","憲法"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080524070201000/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/07/16/LCEWA01_090716_00036.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:63677760b8166198","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第7會期第1次臨時會第1次全院委員會會議","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第1次臨時會第1次全院委員會會議","date":"2019-06-25","highlight":{"excerpt":"大法官的位置真的很重要，一個民主國家的基本理念和憲政走向都有賴於大法官對於憲法的解釋，所以今天大法官的適任與否不是只有對你的品格要求，對於您的專業知識、能力以及對於人權保障的堅持更是不可或缺，所以今天我有一些問題要請教大法官楊被提名人，針對","terms":["大法官","憲法"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":10,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/64/LCIDC01_1086402.pdf","printed_pages":"41-112"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/64/LCIDC01_1086402.pdf","printed_pages":"41-112"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:b49d7227ceb1b741","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期第15次會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期第15次會議","date":"2019-12-31","highlight":{"excerpt":"針對目前境外勢力對於我們臺灣選舉、遊說或集會遊行的這些過程，就臺灣現有的法律而言，包括刑法、政治獻金法、遊說法、國家安全法、國家機密保護法、兩岸人民關係條例、公職人員選舉罷免法、總統副總統選舉罷免法等，都有相關條文可以處理，臺灣的民眾都很清","terms":["選舉","公職","罷免"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":6,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/106/LCIDC01_10810601.pdf","printed_pages":"1-21"},{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/117257","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:0b851d0eabe20f7c","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-12-31","highlight":{"excerpt":"監察委員可以針對公務人員在違法或失職的部分進行彈劾，然而涉及認事用法的部分，監察干涉司法，嚴重地侵犯了我國司法獨立審判的核心價值，本席在這裡呼籲監察委員們要固守他們的職權本分，不要輕易越權，政府對於監察委員的行為，也不應該視若無睹。","terms":["監察委員","公務人員"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":4,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/106/LCIDC01_10810601.pdf","printed_pages":"177-178"}]}],"international":[{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080328070200700","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「駐外機構組織通則第十條條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第8次會議","date":"2019-04-09","highlight":{"excerpt":"爰此，擬具「駐外機構組織通則第十條條文修正草案」，降低外交人員聘用專門人才之比例至百分之一。","terms":["駐外","外交"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080328070200700/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/07/08/LCEWA01_090708_00022.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:66cd5b5f52a6292c","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-03-05","highlight":{"excerpt":"針對上個月21日台灣首度缺席世界衛生組織（WHO）流感疫苗選株會議一事，加上昨天外交部部長吳釗燮也在委員會表示掌握到與我們有邦交的幾個國家最近都有動搖，本席認為以目前蔡政府這種強烈否定九二共識和一國兩制的立場，我相信這樣艱困的外交情況對台灣","terms":["WHO","外交","外交部","邦交"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":7,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/17/LCIDC01_1081701.pdf","printed_pages":"101-106"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:684e9ec14a382f51","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-02-26","highlight":{"excerpt":"接下來關於外交，民進黨政府一直告訴我們全國的老百姓，所有的中華民國國民說，我們盡全力在各方面要維護台灣的主權，但是我們看到的卻是雪崩式的斷交，我們建交達19年的聖多美普林西比已經跟我們斷交，不管是什麼原因，斷交就是斷交，而你們卻什麼都可以怪","terms":["外交","斷交","建交"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":7,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/16/LCIDC01_1081602.pdf","printed_pages":"67-142"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/16/LCIDC01_1081602.pdf","printed_pages":"67-142"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:438995816c658fa4","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-12-13","highlight":{"excerpt":"立院的同仁到外交部，希望外交部長可以給大眾一個交代，外交部卻大門深鎖，部長避不見面。","terms":["外交","外交部"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":6,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/103/LCIDC01_10810302.pdf","printed_pages":"449-450"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:035af15f7f481d57","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期第6次會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期第6次會議","date":"2019-10-18","highlight":{"excerpt":"過去我們臺灣的外交從2000年開始，就是陳水扁上任擔任總統，那時候我們有29個邦交國，到現在19年過去了，現在是2019年，我們現在只剩下15個邦交國，有14個邦交國跟我們斷交，其中有7個是在這三年多來，就是蔡英文政府的時候斷交的。","terms":["外交","邦交","斷交"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":6,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/74/LCIDC01_1087401.pdf","printed_pages":"1-29"},{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/116253","printed_pages":null}]}],"law_crime":[{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080221070200300","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「中華民國刑法第七十七條條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第3次會議","date":"2019-03-05","highlight":{"excerpt":"若僅提高刑度，卻未讓施虐者接受完整之教化並服完刑期，即依現行假釋規定，獲准假釋復歸社會，除了讓施虐者存有僥倖心態，更對於受害兒童及其他兒童構成身心威脅，爰擬具「中華民國刑法第七十七條條文修正草案」，犯刑法第二百八十六條「妨害幼童發育罪」罪者","terms":["假釋","刑法"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":5,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080221070200300/details","printed_pages":null},{"kind":"bill_doc","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/download/agenda1/02/pdf/09/07/03/LCEWA01_090703_00024.pdf","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080221070200500","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「中華民國刑法第一百八十五條之三條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第3次會議","date":"2019-03-05","highlight":{"excerpt":"法單位一再宣導「酒後不開車，開車不喝酒」，社會上亦對酒駕行為深惡痛絕及零容忍，但司法實務上，仍普遍認為酒後駕車屬非故意之過失傷害與殺人，與一般民眾及受害者家屬認為是知法犯法的行為，產生嚴重落差，而違反現行刑法「公共危險罪」酒駕肇事致死者處3","terms":["司法","刑法"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":4,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080221070200500/details","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080221070200400","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「中華民國刑法部分條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第3次會議","date":"2019-03-05","highlight":{"excerpt":"庭暴力防治法」及「兒童及少年福利與權益保障法」等規定，但幾乎是以行政罰為主，現行刑法中，對於配偶施暴僅適用一般傷害罪，對於未滿16歲的兒童施以凌虐，僅在刑法第二百八十六條妨害幼童發育罪中規定，虐童致死也僅適用殺人罪，即使有「兒童及少年福利與","terms":["刑法"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":2,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080221070200400/details","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:63677760b8166198","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第7會期第1次臨時會第1次全院委員會會議","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第1次臨時會第1次全院委員會會議","date":"2019-06-25","highlight":{"excerpt":"楊院長這次被提名為大法官，其實司法界普遍是肯定你的，過去你也曾經獲得高雄律師公會提名說你裁判的品質最佳，同事對你的評估也都非常良好，甚至你被提名的評價都說你的審判經驗豐富、司法行政歷練完整，你也期許你自己成為大法官之後你要做什麼，你要做一個","terms":["法官","司法","審判"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":6,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/64/LCIDC01_1086402.pdf","printed_pages":"41-112"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/64/LCIDC01_1086402.pdf","printed_pages":"41-112"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:0b851d0eabe20f7c","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-12-31","highlight":{"excerpt":"前總統馬英九洩密案無罪判定，監察委員陳師孟就立刻約詢臺北地方法院承審法官唐玥，引起了所有法界強力的反彈，法官協會從18日開始發起捍衛獨立審判連署運動，到現在已經有超過七成法官連署。","terms":["法院","法官","審判"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":5,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/106/LCIDC01_10810601.pdf","printed_pages":"177-178"}]}],"transportation":[{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"bill:1080221070200500","activity":"bill_primary","title":"「中華民國刑法第一百八十五條之三條文修正草案」，請審議案。","meeting":"第9屆第7會期第3次會議","date":"2019-03-05","highlight":{"excerpt":"為有效遏止酒駕，防範酒駕肇事與再犯，特擬具「中華民國刑法第一百八十五條之三條文修正草案」，除針對酒駕致人於死比照殺人罪論處之外，更對於累犯酒駕者，處以一年以上七年以下有期徒刑之刑責，並沒收其駕駛車輛，且不得易刑處分，以期有效杜絕酒駕之發生。","terms":["酒駕","駕駛","車輛"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":7,"links":[{"kind":"bill_page","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/bills/1080221070200500/details","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:1fd7c71c0d0fc99e","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第7次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第7次全體委員會議","date":"2019-04-03","highlight":{"excerpt":"上禮拜三讀通過道路交通管理處罰條例的修正，把酒駕的罰則都提高了，今天我想要跟部長討論的是疲勞駕駛的問題，因為疲勞駕駛對於道路安全的危險性，其實也不輸於酒後駕車，交通部曾經統計過，分心跟疲勞駕駛占交通事故的兩成左右；各類事故的比例中則是占第二","terms":["道路","交通","酒駕","駕駛","交通部"],"cut":[false,true]},"hits":10,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/35/LCIDC01_1083501.pdf","printed_pages":"359-406"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/35/LCIDC01_1083501.pdf","printed_pages":"359-406"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:9dc3223b7b6ddebf","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期交通委員會第5次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期交通委員會第5次全體委員會議","date":"2019-10-14","highlight":{"excerpt":"因此就產生了很多車行的靠行現象，造成車行剝削車主、惡性削價競爭等問題，甚至是超時駕駛、刪減車輛安全配備，還有忽視安全教育等很多情況，所以怎麼樣有效改善整個遊覽車業的狀況、產業結構，我認為是現在臺灣刻不容緩的重要事情，請問部長、局長，8月6日","terms":["駕駛","車輛"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":8,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/81/LCIDC01_1088101.pdf","printed_pages":"207-270"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/81/LCIDC01_1088101.pdf","printed_pages":"207-270"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:53112778beca83a9","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第2次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第2次全體委員會議","date":"2019-02-25","highlight":{"excerpt":"次就乘以2，但是我覺得這個保費的罰鍰實在太低，我的建議是要增加，因為就算我犯三次酒駕，也才加罰1萬800元，事實上，酒駕民眾對此是沒有感覺的；而且我建議增加的費用也不應該由政府取得，增加的費用和易科罰金的錢都應該用來成立一個酒駕被害人基金，","terms":["酒駕"],"cut":[true,true]},"hits":8,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/19/LCIDC01_1081901.pdf","printed_pages":"171-242"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/19/LCIDC01_1081901.pdf","printed_pages":"171-242"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:0a8516b414e3cef5","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第15次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第7會期交通委員會第15次全體委員會議","date":"2019-05-22","highlight":{"excerpt":"交通部最大的閒置空間其實就是當年的「一鄉鎮一停車場」，很多鄉鎮都建了停車場卻沒有使用，工程會是不是應該要求交通部避免重蹈覆轍，在前瞻計畫中不要再蓋出一大堆蚊子館？","terms":["交通部","交通","停車"],"cut":[false,false]},"hits":6,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/58/LCIDC01_1085801.pdf","printed_pages":"143-184"},{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/114626","printed_pages":null}]}],"unclassified":[{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:20afca559cdfe7b2","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期第1次臨時會第1次會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期第1次臨時會第1次會議","date":"2020-01-14","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/117323","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:1fc55702a8027097","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期第14次會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期第14次會議","date":"2019-12-13","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/117182","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:3717f155f6a2f4e2","activity":"speech","title":null,"meeting":null,"date":"2019-11-11","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/94/LCIDC01_1089401.pdf","printed_pages":"139-206"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/94/LCIDC01_1089401.pdf","printed_pages":"139-206"}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:6facaad90b6a36b0","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期交通委員會第9次全體委員會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期交通委員會第9次全體委員會議","date":"2019-11-11","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"ivod","url":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Play/Clip/1M/116764","printed_pages":null}]},{"person_id":"ly1209","year":2019,"event_id":"speech:ee7d09748c2574a9","activity":"speech","title":"第9屆第8會期第9次會議","meeting":"第9屆第8會期第9次會議","date":"2019-11-08","highlight":null,"hits":0,"links":[{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/88/LCIDC01_1088801.pdf","printed_pages":"145-188"},{"kind":"gazette_pdf","url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/108/88/LCIDC01_1088801.pdf","printed_pages":"145-188"}]}]}}